{"body":"Fixes https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/25103\r\n\r\nUpdates the test to \r\n* run on Windows-only to avoid the need to have the runtime available \r\n* avoids using IdentityUI since that package doesn't work with this very well (Identity UI splits views in to a separate assembly). ","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/39977","merge_commit_sha":"60abfafe32a4692f9dc4a172665524f163b10012","merged_at":"2022-02-17T22:27:57Z","number":39977,"state":"closed","title":"Re-enable SingleFileExe"}
